Reason:
The removal of the validation check for the instance name in the `ZooKeeperInstance` class allowed invalid instance names to be accepted. The `getInstanceID()` method, which was supposed to throw a `RuntimeException` if the instance name did not exist in ZooKeeper, was no longer guaranteed to be called, leading to failures when accessing resources associated with a non-existent instance.

